[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955467835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-3955467835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":3955467835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rw6Y7","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T00:10:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T00:10:44Z","body":"The MRP isn't runnable as-is, so we can't test this locally.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3955467835/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963869565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-3963869565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":3963869565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sQ9l9","user":{"login":"chlingzool","id":173458448,"node_id":"U_kgDOClbEEA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173458448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool","html_url":"https://github.com/chlingzool","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T04:18:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T04:26:57Z","body":"> MRP目前无法运行，所以我们无法在本地测试。\n\ni fixed mrp im sure it can run","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963869565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3971713184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-3971713184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":3971713184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7su4ig","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-27T09:12:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T09:12:11Z","body":"With the updated MRP I can reproduce the lag, but it's already rather laggy in 4.6.stable.\n| Version | Lag when dragging the viewport around | Lag when switching scene tabs |\n| - | - | - |\n| 4.6.1 | yes | yes |\n| 4.6 | yes | yes |\n| 4.5.1 | no | yes |\n\nProfiling shows that most of the time are spent on collision polygon debug draws:\n<img width=\"1262\" height=\"302\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47f6e1b1-15f7-49b0-8fbd-6ab6d7a699da\" />\n\nWhich is weird, and also not weird, because only then did I find out that each instance of `cb.tscn` (the thing orbiting around) contains a collision polygon of 1024 vertices:\n```gdscript\n# cb_main.gd\n@export var count: int = 1024 ## 细致度\n```\n<img width=\"2457\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa9747e3-f9d4-40ec-93f9-799922b0ef93\" />\n\nWell, yes, given that there's a probable regression caused by unnecessary redraws, it's technically a Godot problem, but personally I suggest you try one or more of the following:\n- Switch to a circular collision shape as an approximation\n- Drastically tune down the vertex count\n- Downsample when setting the collision polygon","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3971713184/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978182019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-3978182019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":3978182019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tHj2D","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-28T22:27:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-28T22:31:32Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.7.dev 1aaea38e7 (Linux). The lag occurs a short while after zooming in or out, likely because of a new feature in 4.6 that causes it to recalculate oversampling:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200\n\nThis apparently also occurs whenever you resize any of the docks, as this changes the viewport's size (even though its zoom level does not change, so recalculating oversampling is probably not needed here).\n\nYou can disable this feature in the View menu:\n\n<img width=\"350\" height=\"414\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d0ab078-2ef8-4bfb-814d-3c54c9e88e4b\" />\n\nI've confirmed that disabling it avoids the freezes in the MRP when changing the zoom level. I still get freezes when resizing docks, but this also happens on 4.5.\n\nThat said, I echo the above sentiment that the test scene is extremely complex in terms of collision point count.\n\ncc @scgm0 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3978182019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3985094451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-3985094451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":3985094451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7th7cz","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T15:29:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T15:29:56Z","body":"> This apparently also occurs whenever you resize any of the docks, as this changes the viewport's size (even though its zoom level does not change, so recalculating oversampling is probably not needed here).\n\nThis is a bit odd because in my PR, `CanvasTtenEditor::_update_oversampling()` simply calls `set_oversampling_override` on the viewport, and internally, `Viewport::set_oversampling_override` includes a check for whether the scaling value has changed.\n\n<img width=\"849\" height=\"93\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e5a0bab-7758-4cab-8e2d-359eaa5d0aa0\" />\n\n<img width=\"700\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76d16a28-773e-48a0-bee9-f058cdd95a3f\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3985094451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4098469447","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-4098469447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":4098469447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70Sa5H","user":{"login":"chlingzool","id":173458448,"node_id":"U_kgDOClbEEA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173458448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool","html_url":"https://github.com/chlingzool","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chlingzool/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T14:37:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T14:39:33Z","body":"@Calinou \nin fact, 4.6.1's performance is worse than 4.6, isn't it?\nso can the performance be optimized in the next version please? i think the performance is important.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4098469447/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5751276504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116700#issuecomment-5751276504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116700","id":5751276504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVs2D2A","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T17:03:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T17:03:02Z","body":"My previous analysis was too vague. I looked into it again recently and can conclude:\n1. Expensive CollisionPolygon2D redraw is the major reason why it freezes/lags. On `NOTIFICATION_DRAW`, it always performs convex decomposition (using a O(n^2) algorithm and in this case, n=1024).\n2. It's easy to trigger a viewport-wide redraw. In `Viewport::_set_size`, once execution go beyond the following early exit, it will call `update_canvas_items()`, recursively calling `queue_redraw()` on every canvas item under the viewport including the polygons.\n    - Changing the zoom level causes a freeze, because `new_font_oversampling != font_oversampling`\n    - Resizing the viewport causes a freeze, because `size != new_size`.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/57277407e77e61b161f35dbd7aeb510f7a9e26a6/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L1163-L1165\n\n---\n\nSimply caching the decomposition result already helps a lot (tested locally).\n- upside: The decomposition is both O(n^2) and deterministic, so it saves quite some time when n is large, and only gets invalidated when the polygon changes.\n- downside: increased memory usage (~8B per vertex + ~64B per convex shape). But I'd say it's rather small, compared to the fixed cost per convex shape (>1KB).\n\n<details>\n<summary>Convex Shape Memory Usage</summary>\n\nWhat | Bytes | Why\n-- | -- | --\n`ConvexPolygonShape2D` | 496 | sizeof\n`GodotConvexPolygonShape2D` | 112 | sizeof\n`GodotShape2D::owners` | 308 | default 23 slots, each slot 12 bytes; 1 element node 32 bytes; 23 * 12 + 32\n`GodotCollisionObject2D::Shape` | 96 | sizeof; element of `GodotCollisionObject2D::shapes`\n`GodotBroadPhase2DBVH::bvh` item slot | >50 | sizeof; `BVH_Tree::(ItemRef + ItemExtra + ItemPairs)`, `TLeaf/TNode` amortized\nTotal | >1062 |\n</details>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5751276504/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]